# AI Capstone Project

## Project Overview

The AI Capstone Project represents the integration of knowledge acquired throughout the Applied AI & Robotics program at Houston Community College.

This repository demonstrates the application of Machine Learning, Deep Learning, Computer Vision, Natural Language Processing, and Intelligent Systems to solve real-world problems.

